# The README template the dashboards charts share. It lives in the
# dashboards-common library, which this chart bundles through its
# `charts/dashboards-common` symlink, so without this line every packaged chart
# and every release Secret would carry a copy. helm-docs reads it from the
# library directory instead. The library's own .helmignore would not help: Helm
# reads only the .helmignore of the chart being packaged.
charts/dashboards-common/README.md.gotmpl
